cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "braneworld-bh-charge-gw"
abstract: >-
  TaylorF2 waveform with the tidal heating phase correction of braneworld-charged
  black holes, and bilby injection and parameter estimation studies (LIGO O5c,
  real O4b noise, Einstein Telescope). Code for the master's thesis "Constraining
  the braneworld charge of black holes using gravitational waves".
authors:
